<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: DejaVu Sans, sans-serif; font-size: 9px; color: #222; }

    .header { background: #2D5016; color: #fff; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; }
    .header .sub { font-size: 9px; opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 3px; }
    .header .meta { font-size: 8px; opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 2px; }

    .info-block { display: flex; gap: 40px; margin-bottom: 14px; font-size: 9px; }
    .info-block .label { color: #666; font-size: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .info-block .val { font-weight: bold; color: #2D5016; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    thead tr { background: #2D5016; color: #fff; }
    thead th { padding: 5px 6px; text-align: left; font-size: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #F0F7E6; }
    tbody tr:nth-child(odd) { background: #fff; }
    tbody td { padding: 4px 6px; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; font-size: 8.5px; }

    .badge-org { background: #d4edda; color: #155724; border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: bold; }
    .badge-no  { background: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; border-radius: 3px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: bold; }

    .footer { margin-top: 20px; border-top: 2px solid #2D5016; padding-top: 8px; font-size: 7.5px; color: #666; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }

    .legal { font-size: 7px; color: #888; margin-top: 6px; font-style: italic; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="header">
    <h1>Quaderno di Campagna Digitale</h1>
    <div class="sub">Registro Trattamenti Fitosanitari — D.Lgs 150/2012 · Reg. CE 1107/2009</div>
    <div class="meta">{{ farm.name }} · {{ farm.municipality }} · Operatore biologico</div>
</div>

<div class="info-block">
    <div>
        <div class="label">Azienda Agricola</div>
        <div class="val">{{ farm.name }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="label">Comune</div>
        <div class="val">{{ farm.municipality }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="label">Superficie totale</div>
        <div class="val">{{ farm.surface|number_format(2) }} ha</div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="label">Periodo</div>
        <div class="val">{{ date_from|date('d/m/Y') }} — {{ date_to|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div class="label">Generato il</div>
        <div class="val">{{ generated|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</div>
    </div>
</div>

{% if treatments|length == 0 %}
<p style="text-align:center; color:#888; padding: 40px 0;">Nessun trattamento nel periodo selezionato.</p>
{% else %}
<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Data</th>
            <th>Parcella</th>
            <th>Coltura</th>
            <th>Sup. (ha)</th>
            <th>Prodotto Commerciale</th>
            <th>Principio Attivo</th>
            <th>Dose/ha</th>
            <th>Qt. Totale</th>
            <th>Avversità</th>
            <th>Metodo</th>
            <th>Operatore</th>
            <th>Bio</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {% for t in treatments %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ t.date|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.parcel.name }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.parcel.variety }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.parcel.surface|number_format(2) }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ t.productName }}</strong></td>
            <td>{{ t.activeSubstance }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.dosePerHa|number_format(2) }} {{ t.doseUnit }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.totalQuantity ? t.totalQuantity|number_format(2) : '—' }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.targetPest }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.applicationMethod ?? '—' }}</td>
            <td>{{ t.operator ?? '—' }}</td>
            <td>{% if t.isOrganic %}<span class="badge-org">✓ Bio</span>{% else %}<span class="badge-no">No</span>{% endif %}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>
{% endif %}

<div class="legal">
    Documento generato automaticamente da AgriTech Cammarata DSS. Conforme a D.Lgs 14 agosto 2012 n°150 e Reg. CE n°1107/2009.
    Il presente quaderno ha valore di registro ufficiale dei trattamenti fitosanitari. L'agricoltore è responsabile della veridicità dei dati inseriti.
</div>

<div class="footer">
    <span>AgriTech Cammarata DSS — Quaderno di Campagna generato il {{ generated|date('d/m/Y H:i') }}</span>
    <span>{{ treatments|length }} trattamento{% if treatments|length != 1 %}i{% endif %} registrato{% if treatments|length != 1 %}i{% endif %}</span>
</div>

</body>
</html>